# cross-track-serving — the same serving sweep, under the same profile, across
# every KV-transfer layer. This is the file that makes "swap the track" a field
# edit instead of a script edit.
#
# Run it:   bash bench/run-manifest.sh cross-track-serving --dry-run
#           bash bench/run-manifest.sh cross-track-serving
#           bash bench/run-manifest.sh cross-track-serving --only mooncake
#
# The comparison is only valid because every row names the SAME profile: same
# depths, same pp/tg, same concurrency, EXACT_TG=1 so output length is fixed.
# Change the profile field on one row and you no longer have a comparison — the
# provenance stamp on each result records which profile it ran under, so that
# mistake is at least visible afterwards.
#
# Each row deploys its track through bench/tracks.registry if nothing is
# already healthy on the port; MODEL comes from the track's registry default
# unless a row overrides it. Rows are deliberately given different ports where
# the tracks can coexist, but note they still contend for the same GPU — run
# them one at a time on a single-GPU host (this runner is sequential by design).
#
# name | benchmark | track | profile | host | env (';' separated)

nixl|llama-benchy|nixl|throughput|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
mooncake|llama-benchy|mooncake|throughput|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
lmcache|llama-benchy|lmcache|throughput|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
lmcache-posix|llama-benchy|lmcache-posix|throughput|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1

# Smoke variants: prove each track deploys and answers before committing a GPU
# to the full sweep above. Same tracks, one-point profile.
nixl-smoke|llama-benchy|nixl|smoke|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
mooncake-smoke|llama-benchy|mooncake|smoke|*|BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1

# The P/D delta (baseline vs prefill/decode split) is a different question and a
# different tool — same profile on both tracks so the two deltas are comparable.
nixl-pd|vllm-serving-nixl|-|pd-handoff|*|NIXL_BACKEND=UCX
mooncake-pd|vllm-serving-mooncake|-|pd-handoff|*|
